    "body": "Generally this looks fine, and indeed is a spec bug fix as you mentioned in the OP. But given https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/45660#issuecomment-2049865930 I'm wondering if we can maybe just turn this into a full task and at least match 2/3 implementations?\r\n\r\nIf that can be done, then we could have a discussion about whether _all_ browsers would be willing to move to microtask timing, but I think that might be unlikely. But at least aligning with 2/3 implementations would put us in a place with no mandatory follow-up work.",
